---
import Layout from '@/layouts/Layout.astro';
import { Services } from '@/components/sections/Services';
import { Approach } from '@/components/sections/Approach';
import { Faq } from '@/components/sections/Faq';
import { Contact } from '@/components/sections/Contact';
import OperatingExperience from '@/components/ui/OperatingExperience.astro';
---
<Layout>
  <section id="top" class="growth-hero">
    <div class="shell growth-hero-grid">
      <div>
        <p class="growth-eyebrow">MLABS GROWTH · AI SYSTEMS FOR REAL WORK</p>
        <h1>Your business is growing.<br /><em>Your to-do list<br />shouldn’t have to.</em></h1>
        <p class="growth-lead">We help brands improve their Shopify store, connect order operations, and put repeatable AI workflows to work. Need tools for your own team? Explore the products we’re building.</p>
        <div class="growth-actions"><a class="growth-button" href="#contact" data-cta-location="home-audit">Find my first fix <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="growth-text-link" href="/products">Explore products <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
        <p class="growth-note">Start with a free 20-minute audit. Get a written scope before paid work.</p>
      </div>
      <figure class="growth-diagram"><img src="/workflow-map.svg" width="640" height="510" alt="Store, orders and marketing feed into a shared workflow, then a human reviews exceptions and decides the next action." fetchpriority="high" /><figcaption>How we scope a connected workflow · illustrative example</figcaption></figure>
    </div>
    <div class="shell"><div class="growth-trust"><span>Built from Mehul’s own brand operations</span><span>Start with one problem</span><span>Clear scope. Client-owned accounts.</span></div></div>
  </section>
  <Services />
  <section id="proof" class="section-space growth-evidence">
    <div class="shell growth-split"><div><p class="eyebrow-accent">THE EXPERIENCE BEHIND THE WORK</p><h2 class="section-title">We know what happens<br /><span class="muted-heading">after the order comes in.</span></h2><p>Mehul’s work spans seasonal products at Sanskrutibydiorin and daily jewellery operations at Diorin Demifine Jewellery. The questions are practical: what needs confirming, what is in stock, and who handles the next exception?</p><p>These are our own brands, not independent client case studies. We use that operating experience to ask better questions about your business and scope the work around your actual constraints.</p><a class="text-link" href="/about">Meet Mehul and see the approach ↗</a></div><OperatingExperience /></div>
  </section>
  <section class="section-space growth-product-band" aria-labelledby="product-heading"><div class="shell growth-split"><div><p class="eyebrow-accent">FOR PEOPLE WHO WANT TO RUN THEIR OWN WORKFLOWS</p><h2 class="section-title" id="product-heading">Useful AI work.<br /><span class="muted-heading">A place to organise it.</span></h2><p>We’re building mlabs Skill Manager to help you organise AI skills, schedule recurring work, and review outputs in one place. A skill is a set of instructions for a repeatable AI task, such as an audit or a content brief.</p><a href="/products/skill-manager" class="growth-button">Explore Skill Manager <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div><article class="growth-card"><span class="growth-status">IN DEVELOPMENT · NOT YET FOR SALE</span><h3>From a saved prompt<br />to a repeatable routine.</h3><ol class="growth-steps"><li><span>01</span>Choose the task and its project context.</li><li><span>02</span>Set when you want it to run.</li><li><span>03</span>Review the output before using it.</li></ol><p>Pricing, supported setup and release timing are still being finalised. Product interest is separate from a service enquiry.</p></article></div></section>
  <Approach />
  <Faq />
  <Contact client:load />
</Layout>
